                  "name": "Intro",
                  "fill": "$on-paper-muted",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 420,
                  "content": "With npm packages, every change to shared code means a version bump, a rebuild and a redeploy of every app that uses it. Module Federation loads code from other deployed apps on demand — ship a change once, and every host picks it up.",
